WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.989
Learn to translate information from a problem into a table or chart and identify and

00:00:04.989 --> 00:00:09.139
extend the patterns in a table or chart to solve a given problem

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:15.900
A village saves 7 cedis on Monday and increases savings by 16 cedis each day. What is

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:21.150
Thursday’s saving? The answer is 55. Write a daily table and add the same step.

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:27.411
A reading club borrows 35 books on Monday, then 11 more each day. What is Thursday’s

00:00:27.411 --> 00:00:30.483
total? Pause and solve it in your exercise book.

00:00:31.283 --> 00:00:35.699
The answer is 68. Thursday is three daily increases after Monday.
